{"time": 1755441449, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1868998480", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056340271", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "“倒是不错，我们下午可以过来哦”"}
{"time": 1755441477, "type": "recv", "message_id": "344321002", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056340271", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "“吃饱了吗？吃饱了该回家了，我们还要做做生意赚钱买更多好吃的”"}
